OL,3,GNEWSACall for free ATM in town losing
OL,4,Alast bank machine
OL,5,
OL,6,FEfforts are under way to secure a
OL,7,Fpermanent free-to-use ATM machine in a
OL,8,FYorkshire Dales town after an
OL,9,Findependent review said that residents
OL,10,Fmust be able to withdraw physical cash.
OL,12,FBarclays announced earlier this month
OL,13,Fthat it planned to remove 132 machines
OL,14,Facross the UK following a review of its
OL,15,FATM network, including the one at the
OL,16,Fformer Barclays building in Hawes.
OL,18,FHowever, cash machine network LINK
OL,19,Frecommended that a free ATM should be
OL,20,Fprovided, because the change would
OL,21,Fleave the town without one.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
